# Normalize line endings: LF in the repository and in working copies, matching
# .editorconfig. Without this, a Windows checkout writes CRLF while CI runs on Linux,
# which produces phantom whole-file diffs and can break shell scripts in containers.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary assets — never touch.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.pdf binary
